Run: mvn quarkus:dev (as administrator)
Quarkus port: 8081 (Keycloak runs on 8080)


Entities (com.hospital.entity)
Department, Doctor, Patient, MedicalRecord, Examination, Diagnosis, DoctorProfile, ExaminationReport, TimeZone, UploadedFile
Relations

Department → Doctor: OneToMany
Doctor → Examination: OneToMany
Patient ↔ MedicalRecord: OneToOne
Doctor ↔ DoctorProfile: OneToOne
Examination ↔ ExaminationReport: OneToOne
Patient ↔ Doctor: ManyToMany
Examination ↔ Diagnosis: ManyToMany
Patient → TimeZone: OneToMany
Patient ↔ UploadedFile: ManyToMany
All collections: FetchType.LAZY

Layers

repository: PatientRepository, DoctorRepository (Panache)
service: PatientService, DoctorService, TimeZoneService, UploadedFileService
resource: PatientResource, DoctorResource
client: IpClient, TimeApiClient
dto: TimeZoneResponse, FileUploadForm

Endpoints

POST /patients, GET /patients, GET /patients/{id}, GET /patients/search?firstName=
POST /doctors, GET /doctors (@RolesAllowed("admin")), GET /doctors/{id}, GET /doctors/search?lastName=
GET /doctors/{id}/examinations, GET /doctors/{id}/patients
GET /patients/getTimezoneByIP?userId=xxx
POST /patients/uploadFile?id=xxx (Multipart)
GET /patients/{id}/files


