Key patterns learned (important for exam)
REST client pattern:
java@RegisterRestClient(configKey = "some-key")
@Path("/api/endpoint")
public interface SomeClient {
    @GET
    @Produces(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)
    SomeResponse getData(@QueryParam("param") String param);
}
External calls MUST be outside @Transactional (transaction timeout issue learned the hard way)
@JsonIgnore on all LAZY collections to avoid LazyInitializationException during serialization
NotFoundException from jakarta.ws.rs automatically maps to HTTP 404
Multipart DTO pattern:
javapublic class FileUploadForm {
    @FormParam("filename")
    public String filename;
    @FormParam("file")
    @PartType(MediaType.APPLICATION_OCTET_STREAM)
    public InputStream file;
}

